Please note that if you copy eBones-p9.tar.Z you need to replace the
DES library with the newer libdes.tar.18-05-92.Z (or the version
posted to comp.sources.misc, patchlevel 2 (version 1.95))
The bugs fixes since the original des library are.

Version 1.94 05/05/92 eay
        Fixed an incompatiblity between my string_to_key and the MIT
         version.  When the key is longer than 8 chars, I was wrapping
        with a different method.  To use the old version, define
         OLD_STR_TO_KEY in the makefile.  Thanks to
         viktor@newsu.shearson.com (Viktor Dukhovni).

Version 1.8 15/10/91 eay
        Bug in cbc_cksum.
        Many thanks to Keith Reynolds (keithr@sco.COM) for pointing this
        one out.

Version 1.40 23/10/1990 eay
        Fixed des_random_key, it did not produce a random key :-(


